{"seq":2,"slug":"opentelemetry","title":"OpenTelemetry 实战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/observability-engineering/distributed-tracing/opentelemetry","wordCount":1034,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"opentelemetry-实战\">OpenTelemetry 实战</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>OpenTelemetry（OTel）是 CNCF 的可观测性标准框架，统一了分布式追踪、指标和日志的 API、SDK 和数据协议。OpenTelemetry 的目标是提供厂商中立的遥测数据采集能力——应用使用 OTel SDK 生成遥测数据，通过 OTLP（OpenTelemetry Protocol）发送到 OTel Collector，Collector 将数据导出到任意后端（Jaeger、Prometheus、Loki、Datadog 等）。更换后端无需修改应用代码，实现了遥测数据的可移植性。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[应用代码] --&gt; B[OTel SDK]&#10;    B --&gt;|自动插桩| C[HTTP/gRPC/DB Span]&#10;    B --&gt;|手动插桩| D[业务 Span]&#10;    B --&gt;|OTLP| E[OTel Collector]&#10;    E --&gt;|Receiver| F[接收管道]&#10;    F --&gt;|Processor| G[处理管道]&#10;    G --&gt;|Exporter| H[Jaeger/Tempo]&#10;    G --&gt;|Exporter| I[Prometheus]&#10;    G --&gt;|Exporter| J[Loki]\">graph TD\n    A[应用代码] --&gt; B[OTel SDK]\n    B --&gt;|自动插桩| C[HTTP/gRPC/DB Span]\n    B --&gt;|手动插桩| D[业务 Span]\n    B --&gt;|OTLP| E[OTel Collector]\n    E --&gt;|Receiver| F[接收管道]\n    F --&gt;|Processor| G[处理管道]\n    G --&gt;|Exporter| H[Jaeger/Tempo]\n    G --&gt;|Exporter| I[Prometheus]\n    G --&gt;|Exporter| J[Loki]</pre><p>OpenTelemetry 核心组件：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>部署位置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>API</td>\n<td>遥测数据生成的标准接口</td>\n<td>应用进程内</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SDK</td>\n<td>API 的实现，处理采样/导出</td>\n<td>应用进程内</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Instrumentation</td>\n<td>自动/手动插桩库</td>\n<td>应用进程内</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OTLP</td>\n<td>遥测数据传输协议</td>\n<td>网络层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Collector</td>\n<td>遥测数据接收/处理/导出</td>\n<td>独立进程/Sidecar</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Semantic Conventions</td>\n<td>属性命名标准</td>\n<td>规范文档</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"sdk-集成与自动插桩\">SDK 集成与自动插桩</h2><p>OpenTelemetry SDK 分为自动插桩（Auto-Instrumentation）和手动插桩（Manual Instrumentation）两种集成方式。自动插桩通过运行时注入或编译时修改，自动为常用框架和库（HTTP 服务器、数据库驱动、消息队列客户端）生成 Span，无需修改业务代码。手动插桩由开发者在关键业务逻辑中创建自定义 Span，记录业务特定的上下文信息。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { NodeSDK } from &#39;@opentelemetry/sdk-node&#39;;&#10;import { OTLPTraceExporter } from &#39;@opentelemetry/exporter-trace-otlp-grpc&#39;;&#10;import { OTLPMetricExporter } from &#39;@opentelemetry/exporter-metrics-otlp-grpc&#39;;&#10;import { getNodeAutoInstrumentations } from &#39;@opentelemetry/auto-instrumentations-node&#39;;&#10;import { PeriodicExportingMetricReader } from &#39;@opentelemetry/sdk-metrics&#39;;&#10;&#10;const sdk = new NodeSDK({&#10;  serviceName: &#39;order-service&#39;,&#10;  traceExporter: new OTLPTraceExporter({&#10;    url: &#39;http://otel-collector:4317&#39;,&#10;  }),&#10;  metricReader: new PeriodicExportingMetricReader({&#10;    exporter: new OTLPMetricExporter({&#10;      url: &#39;http://otel-collector:4317&#39;,&#10;    }),&#10;    exportIntervalMillis: 15000,&#10;  }),&#10;  instrumentations: [getNodeAutoInstrumentations()],&#10;});&#10;&#10;sdk.start();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { NodeSDK } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@opentelemetry/sdk-node'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { OTLPTraceExporter } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@opentelemetry/exporter-trace-otlp-grpc'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { OTLPMetricExporter } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@opentelemetry/exporter-metrics-otlp-grpc'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { getNodeAutoInstrumentations } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@opentelemetry/auto-instrumentations-node'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { PeriodicExportingMetricReader } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@opentelemetry/sdk-metrics'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sdk</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NodeSDK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  serviceName: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order-service'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  traceExporter: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OTLPTraceExporter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    url: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'http://otel-collector:4317'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  metricReader: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PeriodicExportingMetricReader</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    exporter: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OTLPMetricExporter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      url: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'http://otel-collector:4317'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    exportIntervalMillis: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">15000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  instrumentations: [</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getNodeAutoInstrumentations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sdk.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">start</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span></code></pre></div><p>手动插桩用于记录业务逻辑中的关键操作，如订单创建、支付处理和库存扣减。通过 <code>tracer.startActiveSpan()</code> 创建 Span，设置 Attributes 记录业务上下文（订单 ID、金额、SKU），通过 <code>span.recordException()</code> 记录异常信息。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { trace, SpanStatusCode } from &#39;@opentelemetry/api&#39;;&#10;&#10;const tracer = trace.getTracer(&#39;order-service&#39;);&#10;&#10;async function createOrder(request: CreateOrderRequest): Promise&lt;Order&gt; {&#10;  return tracer.startActiveSpan(&#39;createOrder&#39;, async (span) =&gt; {&#10;    span.setAttribute(&#39;order.user_id&#39;, request.userId);&#10;    span.setAttribute(&#39;order.item_count&#39;, request.items.length);&#10;    try {&#10;      const order = await orderRepository.create(request);&#10;      span.setAttribute(&#39;order.id&#39;, order.id);&#10;      span.setAttribute(&#39;order.total&#39;, order.total);&#10;      span.setStatus({ code: SpanStatusCode.OK });&#10;      return order;&#10;    } catch (error) {&#10;      span.recordException(error as Error);&#10;      span.setStatus({ code: SpanStatusCode.ERROR, message: (error as Error).message });&#10;      throw error;&#10;    } finally {&#10;      span.end();&#10;    }&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { trace, SpanStatusCode } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@opentelemetry/api'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> tracer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trace.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getTracer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order-service'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createOrder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">request</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CreateOrderRequest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tracer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">startActiveSpan</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'createOrder'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">span</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    span.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setAttribute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order.user_id'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, request.userId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    span.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setAttribute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order.item_count'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, request.items.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> order</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orderRepository.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">create</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(request);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      span.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setAttribute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order.id'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, order.id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      span.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setAttribute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order.total'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, order.total);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      span.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ code: SpanStatusCode.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">OK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (error) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      span.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">recordException</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(error </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      span.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ code: SpanStatusCode.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ERROR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, message: (error </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).message });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      throw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> error;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">finally</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      span.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">end</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>语义约定（Semantic Conventions）标准化了 Span 属性的命名，确保不同语言和框架生成的遥测数据具有一致的结构。HTTP Span 使用 <code>http.request.method</code>、<code>url.full</code>、<code>http.response.status_code</code> 等标准属性名，数据库 Span 使用 <code>db.system</code>、<code>db.statement</code>、<code>db.operation</code> 等属性名。</p>\n<h2 id=\"collector-架构与部署\">Collector 架构与部署</h2><p>OpenTelemetry Collector 是遥测数据的中转站，采用 Pipeline 架构：Receiver 接收数据 → Processor 处理数据 → Exporter 导出数据。多个 Pipeline 可以并行运行，处理不同类型的遥测数据。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"receivers:&#10;  otlp:&#10;    protocols:&#10;      grpc:&#10;        endpoint: 0.0.0.0:4317&#10;      http:&#10;        endpoint: 0.0.0.0:4318&#10;&#10;processors:&#10;  batch:&#10;    timeout: 5s&#10;    send_batch_size: 1024&#10;  memory_limiter:&#10;    check_interval: 1s&#10;    limit_mib: 512&#10;  attributes:&#10;    actions:&#10;      - key: environment&#10;        value: production&#10;        action: upsert&#10;  tail_sampling:&#10;    decision_wait: 10s&#10;    policies:&#10;      - name: errors&#10;        type: status_code&#10;        status_code: { status_codes: [ERROR] }&#10;      - name: slow-traces&#10;        type: latency&#10;        latency: { threshold_ms: 1000 }&#10;&#10;exporters:&#10;  otlp/tempo:&#10;    endpoint: tempo:4317&#10;    tls: { insecure: true }&#10;  prometheusremotewrite:&#10;    endpoint: http://mimir:9009/api/v1/push&#10;  loki:&#10;    endpoint: http://loki:3100/loki/api/v1/push&#10;&#10;service:&#10;  pipelines:&#10;    traces:&#10;      receivers: [otlp]&#10;      processors: [memory_limiter, batch, tail_sampling]&#10;      exporters: [otlp/tempo]&#10;    metrics:&#10;      receivers: [otlp]&#10;      processors: [memory_limiter, batch]&#10;      exporters: [prometheusremotewrite]&#10;    logs:&#10;      receivers: [otlp]&#10;      processors: [memory_limiter, batch, attributes]&#10;      exporters: [loki]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">receivers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  otlp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    protocols</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      grpc</span><s