\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">otlp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      processors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">memory_limiter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">batch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">tail_sampling</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      exporters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">otlp/tempo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    metrics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      receivers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">otlp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      processors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">memory_limiter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">batch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      exporters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">prometheusremotewrite</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    logs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      receivers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">otlp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      processors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">memory_limiter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">batch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">attributes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      exporters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">loki</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Collector 的部署模式包括 Agent（Sidecar/DaemonSet）和 Gateway 两种。Agent 模式在每个节点或 Pod 旁部署 Collector 实例，负责本地数据的接收和初步处理。Gateway 模式部署集中式 Collector 集群，接收所有 Agent 转发的数据，执行尾部采样等全局策略后导出到后端。生产环境推荐 Agent + Gateway 两层架构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多语言生态与最佳实践\">多语言生态与最佳实践</h2><p>OpenTelemetry 提供 11+ 种编程语言的 SDK 和自动插桩库，覆盖 Java、Python、Go、Node.js、.NET、Rust、PHP、Ruby、Swift、Erlang 和 C++ 等主流语言。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语言</th>\n<th>SDK 成熟度</th>\n<th>自动插桩</th>\n<th>典型框架支持</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Java</td>\n<td>GA</td>\n<td>Agent（字节码注入）</td>\n<td>Spring、Quarkus、Micronaut</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Python</td>\n<td>GA</td>\n<td>包装器</td>\n<td>Django、Flask、FastAPI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Go</td>\n<td>GA</td>\n<td>无（需手动）</td>\n<td>net/http、gRPC、Gin</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Node.js</td>\n<td>GA</td>\n<td>require Hook</td>\n<td>Express、Hono、NestJS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>.NET</td>\n<td>GA</td>\n<td>CLR 注入</td>\n<td>ASP.NET、EF Core</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rust</td>\n<td>Beta</td>\n<td>无（需手动）</td>\n<td>Actix、Axum、Tonic</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最佳实践包括：在应用启动的最早期初始化 SDK（确保所有框架加载前完成插桩）；使用 <code>OTEL_SERVICE_NAME</code> 等环境变量配置 SDK 参数（避免硬编码）；在 Kubernetes 中通过 Operator 自动注入 SDK 配置；为关键业务操作添加手动 Span，自动插桩覆盖基础设施层面。</p>\n<p>资源检测（Resource Detection）自动识别应用运行环境的元数据（Kubernetes Pod Name、Node Name、Container ID、Cloud Provider/Region），附加到所有遥测数据上。这些元数据使运维人员能够快速定位问题发生在哪个节点、Pod 和容器中。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>OpenTelemetry 提供厂商中立的遥测采集标准，通过 OTLP 协议实现后端可替换</li>\n<li>自动插桩零代码修改覆盖基础设施层，手动插桩记录关键业务操作的上下文</li>\n<li>Collector 的 Pipeline 架构实现数据的接收、处理和多后端导出</li>\n<li>Agent + Gateway 两层部署架构平衡了本地性能和全局策略执行</li>\n<li>语义约定标准化 Span 属性命名，确保跨语言跨框架的遥测数据一致性</li>\n<li>环境变量配置和 Kubernetes Operator 简化了 SDK 的部署和管理</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"OpenTelemetry 实战","id":"opentelemetry-实战"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"SDK 集成与自动插桩","id":"sdk-集成与自动插桩"},{"level":2,"text":"Collector 架构与部署","id":"collector-架构与部署"},{"level":2,"text":"多语言生态与最佳实践","id":"多语言生态与最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"分布式追踪概念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/observability-engineering/distributed-tracing/tracing-concepts"},"next":{"title":"性能分析与追踪优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/observability-engineering/distributed-tracing/performance-analysis"}}